:: A2 Gerold Council Radio Talk 1 [dialogue act2 char-GeroldGranite]

<<stage "It doesn't take long for you to set the radio to the frequency you were given. Once set, a calm male voice speaks to you through the radio.">>
<<say "Gerold Granite" "Investigator, can you hear me?" "professional">>
<<timed 2s t8n>>
<<choices>>
<<reply "I read you." "A2 Gerold Council Radio Talk 2a" 5>>
<<reply "How can you get a radio signal to reach this far down?" "A2 Gerold Council Radio Talk 2b" -5>>
<</choices>>
<</timed>>

:: A2 Gerold Council Radio Talk 2a [dialogue act2 char-GeroldGranite]
<<say "Gerold Granite" "I am Gerold Granite, Liason to the Council. It is my job to maintain a line between you and them during your mission. Let's skip the pleasantries and get right to work." "professional">>
<<stage "It is plain to you at this point that this Gerold is not one to waste time or energy.">>
<<say "Gerold Granite" "The radio that is now in your possession must be kept on your person at all times. It should be easy to attach to your suit." "professional">>
<<stage "While you are attaching your radio, Gerold continues to speak.">>
<<say "Gerold Granite" "Now, what info do you have on the situation below thus far?" "professional">>

:: A2 Gerold Council Radio Talk 2 [dialogue act2 char-GeroldGranite]
<<stage "A short and subtle groan can barely be heard through the radio's speaker.">>
<<say "Gerold Granite" "You should have been informed of this prior to your departure. I suggest you consult your notes. Anyway..." "Restrained annoyance">>
<<stage "The man on the other end took an audible breath and began to explain.">>
<<say "Gerold Granite" "I am Gerold Granite, Liason to the Council. Through me, you have a direct line to the Council and vice-versa. Now let's get to work, shall we?" "professional">>

